      "marks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "block-004",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "narrative",
      "content": "那天没有新的消息，我第一次听见窗外连续的鸟鸣。",
      "importance": 0.58,
      "sectionId": "section-02",
      "groupId": "group-02",
      "relationToPrevious": "continuation",
      "sourceOrder": 3,
      "sourceRefs": ["source-004"],
      "marks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "block-005",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "narrative",
      "content": "我仍然担心停下来会落后，但身体先替我做出了选择。",
      "importance": 0.68,
      "sectionId": "section-02",
      "groupId": "group-02",
      "relationToPrevious": "same-group",
      "sourceOrder": 4,
      "sourceRefs": ["source-005"],
      "marks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "block-006",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "key-insight",
      "content": "后来我才明白，真正的问题不是做得不够多，而是从未问过自己为什么出发。",
      "importance": 0.9,
      "sectionId": "section-03",
      "groupId": "group-03",
      "relationToPrevious": "turning-point",
      "sourceOrder": 5,
      "sourceRefs": ["source-006"],
      "marks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "block-007",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "reflection",
      "content": "慢下来以后，事情没有消失，我却重新看见了它们的轻重。",
      "importance": 0.76,
      "sectionId": "section-03",
      "groupId": "group-03",
      "relationToPrevious": "after-strong-block",
      "sourceOrder": 6,
      "sourceRefs": ["source-007"],
      "marks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "block-008",
      "type": "ending",
      "role": "ending",
      "content": "现在，我会给一天留下一小段没有任务的时间。",
